{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Hear.</b> And some of [them are] from Judah, like \"the seed of Jacob\" and like \"the eye of Jacob\" (Deuteronomy 33:28):" "<b>Who swear by YHWH, but not in truth.</b> The meaning: they say with the mouth that they are for the Name, but they are not so in heart and in deed:"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:58:27.801048646Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}